config HAILO_PCI
	tristate "Hailo PCIe AI accelerator (Hailo-8, Hailo-8L, Hailo-8R)"
	depends on PCI
	help
	  Driver for Hailo-8 family AI accelerators on PCIe, from
	  hailo-ai/hailort-drivers. It loads the device firmware from
	  /lib/firmware/hailo and exposes /dev/hailoN to HailoRT.

	  The module is called hailo_pci.
